<title>USA: FOCUS - Trump Hotel, Rank end talks.</title>
<headline>FOCUS - Trump Hotel, Rank end talks.</headline>
<byline>Brendan Intindola</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talks between Trump Hotels &amp; Casino Resorts Inc and Rank Organisation Plc to bring a Hard Rock Casino to Atlantic City unraveled late last week, dashing a project that would have been a boon to Trump, Rank and the entire Atlantic City market.</p>
<p>With the talks ending acrimoniously, analysts said Trump now must restart plans to renovate the Castle, the most tired of the company's three Atlantic City properties, as heavyweight competitor Mirage Resorts Inc leads a nascent development of the Castle's Marina District.</p>
</text>
